<title>FRANCE: Bollore 1996 net up, raises dividend.</title>
<headline>Bollore 1996 net up, raises dividend.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			     167  vs	     133</p>
<p>    Net dividend (francs)			7.5  vs	     5.0</p>
<p>    Gross dividend (francs)		  11.25  vs	     7.5</p>
<p>    Operating					838  vs	     914</p>
<p>    Pre-tax, pre-exceptional		   710  vs	     633</p>
<p>    Turnover				     22,272 vs	  21,837</p>
<p>NOTE - Bollore Technologies gave the results in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
